---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy & Google AdSense Disclosures | Net Worth Calculator" description="Read our privacy policy, cookie governance, Google AdSense disclosures, and GDPR/CCPA compliance standards. 100% private, client-side calculator execution.">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
		<header class="text-center mb-12 space-y-2">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold">
				<span>🔒</span>
				<span>Privacy Governance & Ad Transparency</span>
			</div>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
		</header>

		<div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-8 font-normal leading-relaxed">
			
			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. 100% Client-Side Private Computation</h2>
				<p>
					At <strong>GetNetWorthCalculator.com</strong>, your financial privacy is our fundamental design constraint. Every calculation—including your age, liquid savings, investment balances, home equity, mortgages, and debt obligations—runs 100% locally in your personal web browser using client-side JavaScript.
				</p>
				<p>
					We do not transmit, record, store, or sell any financial figures or personal net worth inputs to our servers or any third-party entities.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Policy</h2>
				<p>
					To keep our financial tools and educational benchmarks 100% free and accessible to the public without subscription fees or paywalls, we display advertisements served by third-party advertising partners, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
				</p>
				<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 text-xs">
					<p><strong>• Use of Cookies by Ad Networks:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies (such as DoubleClick DART cookies) to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites across the internet.</p>
					<p><strong>• Personalized Advertising:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
					<p><strong>• User Opt-Out Rights:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 underline font-semibold">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 underline font-semibold">www.aboutads.info</a> or <a href="https://www.networkadvertising.org/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 underline font-semibold">Network Advertising Initiative</a>.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Cookies, Web Beacons & Local Storage</h2>
				<p>
					We do not use tracking cookies to construct personal behavioral profiles. Minimal browser LocalStorage is utilized solely to remember your preferred visual theme (dark or light mode) and selected currency symbol across visits. You can clear this at any time through your browser settings.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. GDPR & CCPA/CPRA Compliance Rights</h2>
				<p>
					Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), users possess explicit rights regarding data transparency and control:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs">
					<li><strong>Right to Know / Access:</strong> You have the right to request information regarding any personal data collected. As noted, GetNetWorthCalculator.com stores zero personal financial inputs.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> Users have the right to request deletion of any stored data. Clearing your browser LocalStorage immediately purges all local preferences.</li>
					<li><strong>Non-Discrimination:</strong> We will never discriminate against you for exercising your privacy rights. All calculator features remain 100% free and fully functional.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Contact Information & Privacy Queries</h2>
				<p>
					If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, our Google AdSense compliance, or our client-side data protection architecture, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 underline font-semibold">Contact Page</a> or via email at <code class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 rounded text-xs font-mono">privacy@getnetworthcalculator.com</code>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
